        "html_content": "<strong>2. Chủ ngữ số nhiều</strong><br>Chủ ngữ số nhiều thường đi với: <strong>are, were, have, do, V</strong><strong>o</strong><br><strong>EX:</strong><br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">The employees </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">are</span></strong> in the meeting room.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">The reports </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">were</span></strong> submitted yesterday.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">The companies</span></strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\"> </span><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">have</span></strong> several branches.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">The machines </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">do not </span></strong>work properly.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">The supervisors </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">review</span></strong> the schedule every week."
