        "html_content": "<strong>Both A and B</strong> luôn mang nghĩa số nhiều.<br>Cấu trúc: <strong>Both A and B </strong><em>→</em><strong> </strong><strong>V </strong><strong>số</strong><strong> </strong><strong>nhiều</strong><br><strong>EX:</strong><br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">Both the manager and the supervisor</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hl-red\">are</span></strong> available today.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">Both quality and price </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">are</span></strong> important to customers.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">Both the printer and the scanner </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">work</span></strong> well.<br><strong><span class=\"hl-cyan\">Both the hotel and the restaurant </span></strong><strong><span class=\"hl-red\">offer</span></strong> discounts."
